	(text "The radio on this board has to interface with the one on the groundstation.\nTalk to Andrew about what he is using and make sure they agree.\n\nIt is a LoRa transceiver of some sort, just make sure it is compatible with Andrew's design.\n\nAlso add UART connector, JST-GH, if we ever want to connect to an external radio like\nthe RFD 900x"
